l-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LNG 2019 Q1","e":"lng","d":"2019-05-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jack Fusco","x":"But as a company, we are relatively insulated from the current future tariffs, and we don't expect any material impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/cheniere-energy-lng-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LNG 2019 Q1","e":"lng","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anatol Feygin","x":"So whatever percentage we thought we had laid off going into the year, clearly was much lower in reality because of the volumetric outperformance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/cheniere-energy-lng-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LNG 2019 Q3","e":"lng","d":"2019-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jack Fusco","x":"I'm just curious, one, how have those conversations changed since the trade war started?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/03/cheniere-energy-lng-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LNG 2019 Q3","e":"lng","d":"2019-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jack Fusco","x":"At what point do you think you start to see permanent market share loss from U.S. gulf as the result of tariffs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/03/cheniere-energy-lng-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LNG 2019 Q4","e":"lng","d":"2020-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jack Fusco","x":"Also, while the Phase 1 trade agreement with China and subsequent opportunity for short-term LNG tariff waivers are positive steps, we will await clarity on implementation and enforcement, especially in light of the coronavirus and what impact that may have on our Chinese foreign trade in the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/cheniere-energy-lng-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"LNG 2019 Q4","e":"lng","d":"2020-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Anatol Feygin",